  "findings": [
    "All 7 episodes exported and passed --verify --check-media --check-source on first attempt; no error path was triggered.",
    "3 of 7 datasets record action and observation.state with different channel counts (UR5 7/8, Columbia 7/8, Unitree H1 40/19). The viewer correctly shows them separately but did not say why; 0.18.3 listed only the counts.",
    "Camera headers repeated the observation.images. prefix, truncating four-camera layouts."
  ],
  "changes": [
    "The viewer now states when and why command and measurement are not overlaid and that no channel mapping is guessed.",
    "Camera headers drop the observation.images. prefix; the full key remains in the tooltip."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "One maintainer, warm pip cache, episode 0 only.",
    "Success means a replay that opens and verifies; it does not establish that a user can diagnose a failure faster than with Rerun or the LeRobot visualizer.",
